NAME
    loderunner-ng is a classic Lode Runner game remake heavily based on
    LodeRunner_TotalRecall (https://github.com/SimonHung/LodeRunner_TotalRecall)
    implementation by Simon Hung.

AUTHORS
    Viacheslav Chimishuk <vchimishuk@yandex.ru>

